			],
			"Message": "docs: Remove legacy documentation files from Documentation directory\n\nThis commit removes 43 obsolete documentation files from the Land repository, including:\n- Architecture documentation (AtomicFileStructure, BATCH series, Element definitions, component specs, integration guides, recommendations)\n- Rest build tooling documentation (COMPILER, FINAL_STATUS, IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY, VERIFICATION, etc.)\n- Development workflow documentation (Mountain-Dev-Workflow.md)\n\nThese files represent deprecated or superseded documentation that is no longer relevant to the current Land architecture. The cleanup streamlines the Documentation directory and removes potential confusion from outdated references.",
			"SHA": "fbd1ade2d5e68b9335bc050f8ab5e544d07ab6de"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
