			],
			"Message": "chore: Update devDependencies and clean up VSCode configuration\n\nBump several development tooling dependencies to their latest patch versions:\n- @biomejs/biome: 2.4.4 → 2.4.8\n- @vue/compiler-sfc: 3.5.28 → 3.5.30\n- prettier-plugin-packagejson: 3.0.0 → 3.0.2\n- prettier-plugin-pkg: 0.21.2 → 0.22.0\n- prettier-plugin-sql: 0.19.2 → 0.20.0\n- prettier-plugin-svelte: 3.5.0 → 3.5.1\n- turbo: 2.8.10 → 2.8.20\n\nAlso adds the Target directory exclusion pattern to pnpm-workspace.yaml and removes obsolete RHAI documentation from the .vscode directory to keep the project configuration clean.",
